{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02764",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 5.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Morning, come on through. Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.03,
      "end_seconds": 9.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling tired and low, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.83,
      "end_seconds": 15.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.77,
      "end_seconds": 20.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I've had it for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.53,
      "end_seconds": 24.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.35,
      "end_seconds": 39.4,
      "duration_seconds": 13.05,
      "text": "Yeah, when it starts I tend to get difficulty getting out of bed as well. And there's stiff aching shoulders and hips as well, two weeks now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.94,
      "end_seconds": 42.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Does anything set it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.95,
      "end_seconds": 52.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "Yes, mornings. That makes it worse. The difficulty getting out of bed? That's been for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.2,
      "end_seconds": 59.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.97,
      "end_seconds": 76.5,
      "duration_seconds": 15.53,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I've never touched a cigarette. My husband and I live above the shop. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.15,
      "end_seconds": 82.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.69,
      "end_seconds": 90.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.85,
      "end_seconds": 93.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.46,
      "end_seconds": 99.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Just part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.29,
      "end_seconds": 119.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.11,
      "end_seconds": 123.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.22,
      "end_seconds": 140.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.66,
      "end_seconds": 143.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.26,
      "end_seconds": 147.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Any headache or jaw pain on chewing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.19,
      "end_seconds": 152.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "No, no headache or jaw pain on chewing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.28,
      "end_seconds": 160.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weight loss or visual changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.62,
      "end_seconds": 166.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss or visual changes, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.95,
      "end_seconds": 171.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.21,
      "end_seconds": 175.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.09,
      "end_seconds": 180.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.95,
      "end_seconds": 185.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I mean, no, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.33,
      "end_seconds": 190.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.9,
      "end_seconds": 206.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.6,
      "end_seconds": 228.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.9 degrees, blood pressure 128 over 73, pulse 68, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.75,
      "end_seconds": 231.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.09,
      "end_seconds": 237.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.48,
      "end_seconds": 243.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.87,
      "end_seconds": 254.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.57,
      "end_seconds": 256.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.45,
      "end_seconds": 271.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "The shoulders are painful to move but strength is normal and there is no joint swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.19,
      "end_seconds": 303.16,
      "duration_seconds": 26.97,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. So where does that leave us? It's hard to say. Polymyalgia rheumatica is one possibility and rheumatoid arthritis another, and I'd rather not commit yet. I'm sending you for blood tests because of proximal stiffness. I'll start you on prednisolone, 15 milligrams, once a day, reducing course. That's for polymyalgia rheumatica. Report any headache or jaw pain immediately."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.04,
      "end_seconds": 323.15,
      "duration_seconds": 19.11,
      "text": "The thing that would worry me is if you get a new headache or visual changes. If that happens, go to emergency. I'd like to see you again in two weeks. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.69,
      "end_seconds": 332.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "So, I take the prednisolone, 15 milligrams, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.29,
      "end_seconds": 340.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.67,
      "end_seconds": 344.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Uh, thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}